WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.742
Got an idea for next time? See who's keen.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.089
Ellie shared an idea: a beach day next summer. In place of a rating, it asks: Keen

00:00:11.089 --> 00:00:12.072
to do this?

00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:15.111
Four faces, plus three more. Seven keen.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.284
Joel chooses I'm keen. The button is pressed, it reads You're keen, and the count

00:00:22.284 --> 00:00:23.483
goes up to eight.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.121
Changed your mind? Choose You're keen again, and the count goes back down.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.580
Ellie shared it, so she, or the Host, can choose We did this.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.876
It becomes something we did, and everyone can rate it.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.939
Under Want to do, the card says how many are keen.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.668
On a phone, the panel sits under the picture.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.944
From ten twenty-four pixels, it sits beside it.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.785
What no screen shows: saying it twice changes nothing, and anyone else asking to

00:01:12.785 --> 00:01:14.520
mark it done is refused.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:18.682
Still to come: the count changing live, and comments on an idea.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.670
That is journey twenty. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
